{"id": "wwdc2019-244", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2019/244", "wordCount": 1480, "segments": [{"start": 14.0, "text": "Hi, everyone, my name is"}, {"start": 16.0, "text": "Sommer Panage, and I'm"}, {"start": 18.0, "text": "Engineering Manager on the"}, {"start": 19.0, "text": "Accessibility Team."}, {"start": 21.0, "text": "I'm excited to share with you"}, {"start": 22.0, "text": "three ways in which you can make"}, {"start": 24.0, "text": "your apps more visually"}, {"start": 26.0, "text": "accessible."}, {"start": 28.0, "text": "We will be covering Dynamic Type"}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "as well as some great"}, {"start": 31.0, "text": "improvements to Reduce Motion"}, {"start": 33.0, "text": "and an API that we brought over"}, {"start": 35.0, "text": "from Mac to iOS that we call"}, {"start": 37.0, "text": "Differentiate Without Color."}, {"start": 40.0, "text": "So let's get started with"}, {"start": 41.0, "text": "Dynamic Type."}, {"start": 44.0, "text": "Dynamic Type is a feature that"}, {"start": 45.0, "text": "allows users to customize the"}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "size of the text on their"}, {"start": 49.0, "text": "screen."}, {"start": 50.0, "text": "Now for some users that might"}, {"start": 52.0, "text": "mean smaller text and for others"}, {"start": 55.0, "text": "that might be larger text."}, {"start": 57.0, "text": "Now for some larger text might"}, {"start": 59.0, "text": "just be a preference, but for"}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "others large text can be the"}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "difference between being unable"}, {"start": 65.0, "text": "to use their device and being"}, {"start": 67.0, "text": "able to use it."}, {"start": 71.0, "text": "When you're implementing Dynamic"}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "Type for your users, I'd like to"}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "remind you of four important"}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "principles."}, {"start": 78.0, "text": "First, you make as much of your"}, {"start": 81.0, "text": "text dynamic as possible."}, {"start": 83.0, "text": "If the text can grow, it should grow."}, {"start": 87.0, "text": "Second, use as much of the"}, {"start": 89.0, "text": "screen width as possible."}, {"start": 93.0, "text": "Third, don't truncate text as it"}, {"start": 95.0, "text": "grows."}, {"start": 96.0, "text": "You'll want to display the same"}, {"start": 98.0, "text": "amount of text as your default UI."}, {"start": 101.0, "text": "And, finally, you should scale"}, {"start": 103.0, "text": "glyphs that appear next to text"}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "so that your UI continues to"}, {"start": 107.0, "text": "look balanced."}, {"start": 110.0, "text": "In iOS, there are 11 different"}, {"start": 112.0, "text": "text styles that you can use"}, {"start": 114.0, "text": "with Dynamic Type all the way"}, {"start": 115.0, "text": "from titles down the captions"}, {"start": 117.0, "text": "and footnotes."}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "To use Dynamic Type for your UI"}, {"start": 122.0, "text": "labels, your UI text fields, and"}, {"start": 125.0, "text": "your UI text views, you just"}, {"start": 126.0, "text": "need to use a preferred font for"}, {"start": 128.0, "text": "one of these text styles and"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "you'll want to set the adjust"}, {"start": 133.0, "text": "font for content size categories"}, {"start": 135.0, "text": "flag to true on those views."}, {"start": 137.0, "text": "This guarantees that your view"}, {"start": 139.0, "text": "will update whenever the user"}, {"start": 141.0, "text": "changes their font size even if"}, {"start": 143.0, "text": "your app is in the foreground."}, {"start": 146.0, "text": "As of iOS 11, we made it easier"}, {"start": 149.0, "text": "for you to use Dynamic Type with"}, {"start": 150.0, "text": "your custom fonts as well."}, {"start": 153.0, "text": "You'll want to have one font and"}, {"start": 155.0, "text": "size mapped to each of the 11"}, {"start": 157.0, "text": "text styles that we saw"}, {"start": 159.0, "text": "previously."}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "Here I create my own dictionary"}, {"start": 163.0, "text": "of fonts for each style."}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "Then I can look to see if I have"}, {"start": 167.0, "text": "a font for the given style."}, {"start": 170.0, "text": "If I do, then I scale it as"}, {"start": 171.0, "text": "appropriate using UI font"}, {"start": 173.0, "text": "metrics, and if not, then I fall"}, {"start": 176.0, "text": "back to that preferred system"}, {"start": 178.0, "text": "font."}, {"start": 180.0, "text": "As I'm doing my awesome Dynamic"}, {"start": 182.0, "text": "Type work, I want to be able to"}, {"start": 184.0, "text": "see it and I can now easily"}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "preview it using the new Xcode"}, {"start": 188.0, "text": "environments overwrites pane"}, {"start": 190.0, "text": "seen here. I can just slide the Dynamic"}, {"start": 192.0, "text": "Type slider and instantly in the"}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "simulator see the results."}, {"start": 199.0, "text": "Next, I'd like to talk to you"}, {"start": 201.0, "text": "about reduced motion."}, {"start": 203.0, "text": "So, motion is often an exciting"}, {"start": 205.0, "text": "and dynamic part of iOS."}, {"start": 208.0, "text": "We use motion in many places to"}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "create a more immersive"}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "experience for our customers."}, {"start": 213.0, "text": "However, for some users these"}, {"start": 215.0, "text": "effects might not be desirable."}, {"start": 217.0, "text": "One in three people has some"}, {"start": 219.0, "text": "form of motion sensitivity."}, {"start": 221.0, "text": "Now for most people this means"}, {"start": 223.0, "text": "riding a roller coaster or maybe"}, {"start": 224.0, "text": "reading a book in the car, but"}, {"start": 226.0, "text": "for a small subset of people"}, {"start": 228.0, "text": "that sensitivity could be"}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "triggered by even looking at a"}, {"start": 231.0, "text": "screen with motion on it."}, {"start": 235.0, "text": "To help iOS adapt to all"}, {"start": 237.0, "text": "customers, we already provide a"}, {"start": 239.0, "text": "reduced motion setting in our"}, {"start": 240.0, "text": "accessibility settings to"}, {"start": 242.0, "text": "disable things like weather and"}, {"start": 244.0, "text": "parallax effects in the system."}, {"start": 247.0, "text": "And here's the reduce motion API"}, {"start": 249.0, "text": "that you might already be"}, {"start": 250.0, "text": "familiar with."}, {"start": 251.0, "text": "When reduced motion is on, your"}, {"start": 253.0, "text": "app should adapt its animations"}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "as well."}, {"start": 257.0, "text": "Now another motion effect is"}, {"start": 259.0, "text": "autoplaying video."}, {"start": 261.0, "text": "Here we see that as we scroll"}, {"start": 263.0, "text": "through the App Store trailers"}, {"start": 265.0, "text": "for the featured games begin to"}, {"start": 266.0, "text": "play."}, {"start": 268.0, "text": "Now while for some this might"}, {"start": 269.0, "text": "make them want to click in and"}, {"start": 270.0, "text": "learn more about a fun looking"}, {"start": 272.0, "text": "game; for others this behavior"}, {"start": 274.0, "text": "could be a bit jarring or"}, {"start": 275.0, "text": "perhaps it could trigger some"}, {"start": 276.0, "text": "anxiety."}, {"start": 279.0, "text": "So that users can decide if they"}, {"start": 281.0, "text": "want to see autoplaying video,"}, {"start": 283.0, "text": "we're excited to announce a new"}, {"start": 284.0, "text": "motion setting this year for iOS"}, {"start": 286.0, "text": "13."}, {"start": 288.0, "text": "Settings, accessibility, motion,"}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "auto-play video previews."}, {"start": 292.0, "text": "With this setting disabled our"}, {"start": 294.0, "text": "apps such as App Store will no"}, {"start": 297.0, "text": "longer auto-play content like"}, {"start": 298.0, "text": "trailers but rather they will"}, {"start": 300.0, "text": "require user interaction to"}, {"start": 301.0, "text": "start and stop playback."}, {"start": 303.0, "text": "Auto-play video previews starts"}, {"start": 305.0, "text": "as enabled by default, but you"}, {"start": 308.0, "text": "can turn it off at any time."}, {"start": 310.0, "text": "And, additionally, we've made"}, {"start": 311.0, "text": "this public API."}, {"start": 314.0, "text": "If is video auto-play enabled is"}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "false, you should also make sure"}, {"start": 318.0, "text": "that any videos in your apps"}, {"start": 319.0, "text": "provide a play or pause"}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "avoidance to your users."}, {"start": 323.0, "text": "And, of course, always listen"}, {"start": 324.0, "text": "for that notification to know"}, {"start": 326.0, "text": "when you should change your behavior."}, {"start": 329.0, "text": "Now if your app already provides"}, {"start": 331.0, "text": "an in-app setting, you'll simply"}, {"start": 332.0, "text": "want to mirror that, mirror our"}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "global setting as your default."}, {"start": 337.0, "text": "However, you can still use the"}, {"start": 339.0, "text": "setting in your app to allow"}, {"start": 340.0, "text": "users to customize your"}, {"start": 341.0, "text": "behavior."}, {"start": 343.0, "text": "Another form of motion in iOS is"}, {"start": 345.0, "text": "a transition from one screen to"}, {"start": 348.0, "text": "another."}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "Here we see the typical sliding"}, {"start": 351.0, "text": "transition as we navigate"}, {"start": 353.0, "text": "through our settings app."}, {"start": 360.0, "text": "To provide even more"}, {"start": 361.0, "text": "fine-grained control over the"}, {"start": 363.0, "text": "types of motion that a customer"}, {"start": 364.0, "text": "experiences on iOS, we've"}, {"start": 366.0, "text": "introduced an additional setting"}, {"start": 368.0, "text": "when reduced motion is enabled"}, {"start": 370.0, "text": "and this is called prefer"}, {"start": 372.0, "text": "Cross-fade Transitions."}, {"start": 374.0, "text": "As you can see, by enabling that"}, {"start": 376.0, "text": "setting, my lateral slides have"}, {"start": 379.0, "text": "become dissolved transitions in"}, {"start": 380.0, "text": "the app."}, {"start": 382.0, "text": "Now UIKit implements these"}, {"start": 383.0, "text": "dissolved transitions for you"}, {"start": 385.0, "text": "when the setting is enabled."}, {"start": 386.0, "text": "So as long as you're using UIKit"}, {"start": 388.0, "text": "standard navigation or modal"}, {"start": 390.0, "text": "presentation, you'll get this"}, {"start": 391.0, "text": "behavior for free."}, {"start": 395.0, "text": "Finally, I'd like to talk to you"}, {"start": 397.0, "text": "about Differentiate Without"}, {"start": 398.0, "text": "Color."}, {"start": 400.0, "text": "So colorblindness might cause"}, {"start": 402.0, "text": "numerous colors that appear"}, {"start": 404.0, "text": "different to some to appear very"}, {"start": 406.0, "text": "similar to others."}, {"start": 408.0, "text": "For those with deuteranopia, for"}, {"start": 410.0, "text": "example, some reds and greens"}, {"start": 412.0, "text": "and yellows might all look very"}, {"start": 414.0, "text": "much the same."}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "To see how this might impact"}, {"start": 417.0, "text": "users and how we're solving for"}, {"start": 419.0, "text": "it, I'd like to show you this"}, {"start": 420.0, "text": "little app that my colleagues"}, {"start": 422.0, "text": "and I worked on."}, {"start": 423.0, "text": "So we all really like peanut"}, {"start": 425.0, "text": "butter, and I just added a new"}, {"start": 427.0, "text": "feature so that I can track my"}, {"start": 429.0, "text": "personal peanut butter status."}, {"start": 431.0, "text": "I've added green circles to the"}, {"start": 432.0, "text": "peanut butters that I currently"}, {"start": 433.0, "text": "have, I've added yellow circles"}, {"start": 436.0, "text": "to the ones where I've eaten"}, {"start": 437.0, "text": "them before but I don't have"}, {"start": 438.0, "text": "them right now, and I've added"}, {"start": 440.0, "text": "red circles for the ones I"}, {"start": 441.0, "text": "haven't tried yet."}, {"start": 443.0, "text": "Now if my friend wants to use"}, {"start": 444.0, "text": "this app but they happen to be"}, {"start": 446.0, "text": "colorblind, this might be how it"}, {"start": 448.0, "text": "looks."}, {"start": 449.0, "text": "As you can see, all of the"}, {"start": 450.0, "text": "circles kind of blend together."}, {"start": 453.0, "text": "Now, as of iOS 13, this user can"}, {"start": 456.0, "text": "go over to settings,"}, {"start": 457.0, "text": "accessibility, display in text"}, {"start": 459.0, "text": "size and turn this on --"}, {"start": 462.0, "text": "Differentiate Without Color."}, {"start": 464.0, "text": "As a developer, I can just check"}, {"start": 468.0, "text": "should Differentiate, Without"}, {"start": 470.0, "text": "Color and observe the"}, {"start": 471.0, "text": "Differentiate Without Color to"}, {"start": 473.0, "text": "change notification."}, {"start": 475.0, "text": "If the setting is true, any"}, {"start": 476.0, "text": "place in my app where I use"}, {"start": 478.0, "text": "color as the only way of"}, {"start": 480.0, "text": "conveying information, I should"}, {"start": 482.0, "text": "now add some additional"}, {"start": 483.0, "text": "indicator."}, {"start": 484.0, "text": "For example, a shape."}, {"start": 487.0, "text": "So back to my peanut butter app,"}, {"start": 489.0, "text": "when I see that the user has"}, {"start": 490.0, "text": "turned on Differentiate Without"}, {"start": 492.0, "text": "Color I now replace my circles"}, {"start": 494.0, "text": "with a green check, a yellow"}, {"start": 497.0, "text": "question mark and a red X."}, {"start": 502.0, "text": "So now even if the app appears"}, {"start": 504.0, "text": "like this, we can still discern"}, {"start": 506.0, "text": "the status of my different"}, {"start": 507.0, "text": "peanut butters."}, {"start": 509.0, "text": "Now you might be thinking, hey,"}, {"start": 511.0, "text": "Sommer, wait a minute."}, {"start": 512.0, "text": "The app actually just looks"}, {"start": 513.0, "text": "better this way."}, {"start": 514.0, "text": "Why even bother with the plain"}, {"start": 516.0, "text": "circle version?"}, {"start": 517.0, "text": "And you'd be totally right."}, {"start": 519.0, "text": "In fact, when possible, you"}, {"start": 522.0, "text": "should not rely on color alone"}, {"start": 523.0, "text": "to signal meaning."}, {"start": 525.0, "text": "Now in the case of my peanut"}, {"start": 526.0, "text": "butter app, that's easy."}, {"start": 528.0, "text": "I can just get rid of the"}, {"start": 529.0, "text": "circles, but it's not always"}, {"start": 531.0, "text": "that easy."}, {"start": 533.0, "text": "Here we see the game Causality."}, {"start": 536.0, "text": "The game play is actually"}, {"start": 537.0, "text": "indicated by the color on the"}, {"start": 539.0, "text": "screen."}, {"start": 540.0, "text": "Now this might not be enough"}, {"start": 542.0, "text": "information for all users and so"}, {"start": 544.0, "text": "the game creators provide a"}, {"start": 546.0, "text": "colorblind mode that you see"}, {"start": 547.0, "text": "here."}, {"start": 550.0, "text": "When that's enabled, the players"}, {"start": 551.0, "text": "and the targets now have"}, {"start": 552.0, "text": "symbolic flags above their heads"}, {"start": 555.0, "text": "and associated."}, {"start": 557.0, "text": "The game designers might not"}, {"start": 558.0, "text": "have wanted this extra symbol"}, {"start": 560.0, "text": "noise in the original design,"}, {"start": 563.0, "text": "but for some users this actually"}, {"start": 565.0, "text": "is what makes the game playable."}, {"start": 568.0, "text": "And that's it."}, {"start": 569.0, "text": "With that we've seen three ways"}, {"start": 573.0, "text": "that we can make our apps more"}, {"start": 574.0, "text": "visually accessible to all of"}, {"start": 576.0, "text": "our customers."}, {"start": 578.0, "text": "We can support all text sizes"}, {"start": 579.0, "text": "with Dynamic Type, we can adapt"}, {"start": 582.0, "text": "via new motion settings for our"}, {"start": 584.0, "text": "customers that might have motion"}, {"start": 585.0, "text": "sensitivities, and we can convey"}, {"start": 589.0, "text": "information in different ways"}, {"start": 590.0, "text": "when we check Differentiate"}, {"start": 592.0, "text": "Without Color."}, {"start": 594.0, "text": "Thank you all so much for your"}]}